From: Kalesh Singh <kaleshsingh@google.com>
Subject: mm: arm: introduce arch_mmap_hint()
Date: Wed, 11 Dec 2024 15:27:41 -0800

Introduce arm arch_mmap_hint() and define HAVE_ARCH_MMAP_HINT.  This is a
preparatory patch, no functional change is introduced.

